-   Virtual environment prefix: `/home/deck/OdysseusProject/.venv`
-   Base prefix: `/usr`
-   Data directory: `/home/deck/OdysseusProject/data`
-   Encryption key path: `/home/deck/OdysseusProject/data/.app_key`

This document records the inspected state; it is not a guarantee that
